@startuml
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> AmountSelection: SelectAmount
Idle --> AmountSelection: EnterCustomAmount
AmountSelection --> Verification: SelectAmount
AmountSelection --> Verification: EnterCustomAmount
Verification --> Rejected: TransactionRejected
Verification --> Idle: TransactionAccepted
Rejected --> AmountSelection: ReenterAmount
Rejected --> [*]: End

@enduml
